      "exact_quote": "specified evidence (指明證據) means anything that is or contains, or that is likely to be or contain, evidence of an offence endangering national security",
      "paragraph_text": "4. Section 1 of Schedule 1 of the Implementation Rules provides, inter alia, that: “ specified evidence (指明證據) means anything that is or contains, or that is likely to be or contain, evidence of an offence endangering national security.”",
