      "exact_quote": "the intended judicial review by the plaintiff is bound to fail and leave should accordingly be refused",
      "paragraph_text": "26. In the premises, I accept the Commissioner’s submission that the intended judicial review by the plaintiff is bound to fail and leave should accordingly be refused. C. THE 21 JULY SUMMONS AND ORDER OF THE COURT",
      "chunk_hash": "5488cc6b5c4c36362d116ac8d497b28bc9b579bc4d685e8f8449724308de35b2",
      "quote_verified_against_source": true,
